      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is THE STROKE: one continuous ribbon of blue light with a white-cyan core and a saturated blue emissive body. It never resets; it enters this cut at the left edge and leaves it travelling up and to the right.\n<Subject 2> is the actress: a naturally likeable young Japanese woman in her twenties, dark brown hair tied back in a high ponytail with loose strands at the temples, a bright orange knit cardigan over a light top. She sits at a laptop by a wide window in a bright plant-filled room. Her performance is deliberately small - she never mugs and never over-reacts.\n\nsummary:\nA 1.6-second closing cut of a Japanese commercial for a price-comparison browser extension. The camera is already on the actress at the laptop; she looks up from the screen toward the sky beyond the window as the blue stroke sweeps past her, and the headline holds over the frame.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Picture 1> is fully_preserved as APPEARANCE for <Subject 2>: her hair, her hairstyle and her clothing are taken from this picture and from nothing else. She has a high ponytail and a bright orange knit cardigan for every frame of this cut.\n<Video 1> is fully_preserved as MOTION AND STAGING ONLY, never as appearance: reproduce its framing, its camera height and angle, the actress's position and scale within the frame, the timing of her head and eye movement frame for frame, the travel of the stroke, the background, the window, the plants and the city beyond. Do NOT take her hair or her clothing from <Video 1>; those come from <Picture 1>.\nThe Japanese headline is retained exactly as it appears in <Video 1>: the large white slanted characters read タイパ最強。 with 見るだけで、最安値。 smaller beneath, each character appearing once, none doubled, mirrored or overlapped.\n\ndetailed_description:\n00:00.000 - The frame is already on the actress, seated at the laptop on the right of frame, the window and bright sky filling the left and upper area. The headline タイパ最強。 sits large across the left, 見るだけで、最安値。 beneath it. She wears a bright orange knit cardigan and her hair is in a high ponytail.\n00:00.400 - She lifts her eyes from the screen toward the sky. The blue stroke enters from the lower left and sweeps across in front of the window, its trail scattering small sparkles.\n00:01.000 - The stroke curves up past her and the circular PRICE CHECKER emblem glows into the upper area of the frame. Her expression stays small and pleased; her shoulders barely move.\n00:01.625 - The stroke leaves the top-right of the frame, carrying the eye out of the cut.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nA soft airy room tone with a faint bright shimmer as the stroke passes.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nLight, buoyant electronic pop holding its final phrase, no vocal.\n",
